# perf_tracker archive.jsonl is the irreplaceable append-only source of truth (every run ever
# ingested, ~1MB). It is small + high-value, so track it despite the *.jsonl blanket ignore
# above (review §10). If it ever grows past a few MB, re-ignore it and back it up externally.
!src/perf_tracker/data/archive.jsonl
# generated prior-run snapshot (see perf_tracker/update_table.py); path is under src/ post-refactor
src/perf_tracker/data/last_run.json

